# The edge-diff harness of the compiler-facts call graph (tools/EdgeDiff.hx): per function the facts replace,
# the records the syntax gives it against the ones the facts give it. Build from the repo root; run from the
# project root whose `apqlint.json` names the roots, libraries and compiler oracles. The artifact is gitignored.
#
#   haxe tools/edge-diff.hxml
#   (cd <project> && node <anyparse>/bin/edge-diff.js <out.jsonl>)
-cp src
-cp tools
-main EdgeDiff
-lib hxnodejs
-D js-es=6
-D analyzer-optimize
-js bin/edge-diff.js
